      * Signs and zones: MOVE of negative numbers, zoned results.
     H
     FQSYSPRT O   F     132     OF     PRINTER
     C                     Z-ADD-7        N2      20
     C                     MOVE N2        C2      2
     C                     MOVE '1P'      N2B     20
     C                     Z-ADDN2B       P3      30
     C                     MOVE -12.5     C5      5
     C                     Z-ADD0         Z5      52
     C                     SUB  0.01      Z5
     C                     MULT -1        Z5
     C                     EXCPTLINE
     C                     SETON                     LR
     OQSYSPRT E  1             LINE
     O                         C2         5
     O                         N2B   J   15
     O                         P3    J   25
     O                         C5        35
     O                         Z5    J   45
     O                         Z5        55
